  "body": "Auction: on site on Thursday 10 December 2026 at 7:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSecure your slice of Stanmore Bay paradise where space, sun, and sweeping Hauraki Gulf views come together effortlessly. Positioned on a rare, full 809sqm freehold section, this north-facing family sanctuary offers the ultimate blend of relaxed coastal living and smart long-term value.\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern families and effortless entertaining, the open-plan kitchen, dining, and living zone flows seamlessly onto expansive covered decking. Host summer BBQs with Kawau, Little Barrier, and Great Barrier Islands as your daily backdrop, overlooking manicured, established gardens.\r\n\r\n4 generous bedrooms plus a versatile 5th bedroom/second lounge across two levels—ideal for extended family, teenagers, or working from home. Contemporary kitchen, master with ensuite, family bathroom plus separate WC, heat pump, and full Healthy Homes compliance. Ample off-street parking for the boat or campervan, plus garden shed.\r\n\r\nWalk to Stanmore Bay Beach, top local schools, parks, shops, and eateries.\r\n\r\nMove-in ready and priced to meet the market—opportunities combining this land size, view, and condition are increasingly rare.\r\n\r\nDon’t just dream of the coastal lifestyle—own it. Contact us today for a private inspection or join us at the open home.",
